+  # LOCAL PATCH (researchflow vet 2026-11-21): contain the analyzer. Read only
+  # PROJECT_DIR, write only INSTINCTS_DIR, no Bash, no MCP, no skills. No settings
+  # file is loaded (user, project or local), so no allow rule or hook from any of
